reader.special:
Check whether the Book omen has been discovered. If the Book has not appeared, then when a hero places a new room and would draw an omen, search the omen deck for the Book instead. Shuffle the omen deck.

Heroes must speak the Mummy's true name to banish him. You must complete the following steps in order. Each hero may attempt only one step each turn.

Make a 6+ Knowledge check in one of these rooms to find the Mummy's true name in the book.

•The room with the sarcophagus, to study hieroglyphs;
•The Research Laboratory, to read the expedition notes;
•The Library, to study the Mummy's history;

If you succeed at the Knowledge check, take 1 Knowledge token.

On a turn after you found the name, any hero holding the Book omen may attempt a 6+ Knowledge check to find the true name in the book and learn the banishment spell. If successful, take 1 Knowledge token.

Once the heroes have 2 tokens, the hero holding the Book must go to the Mummy's room. When the Book and Mummy are in the same room, any hero in that room may attack the Mummy with Sanity. If the Mummy is defeated, it is banished forever.

Heroes, including heroes with the Revolver or Dynamite, cannot make Speed attacks against the Mummy.
